{
	"description": "IAB GPP strings and in-app IABGPP_* keys both native cores must produce. Expected values come from the web encoder in packages/iab/src/gpp and decode with @iabgpp/cmpapi; packages/iab/src/__tests__/native-gpp-fixtures.test.ts checks both on every run. US National is MSPA version 2, the version the IAB reference libraries decode.",
